# Copy effects apply in timestamp order, and one ending leaves the rest (CR 613.2a, 613.7, 611.2b). Mirrorweave makes each
# other creature a copy of Bot2's Haywire Mite until end of turn; then Assimilation Aegis is equipped to the first Ornithopter,
# a later copy effect: it is a Llanowar Elves (the card the Aegis exiled). The Aegis moves to the second Ornithopter: the
# first one's later copy effect ends and the earlier one is still there, so it is a Haywire Mite again, not a Llanowar Elves
# and not an Ornithopter. As the turn ends Mirrorweave's effect ends too, and the first is an Ornithopter.

